# Sealed (encrypted) manifests only. Everything else here is assumed to be a
# plaintext Secret someone dumped while working and is ignored so that it cannot
# be committed by reflex — `git add .` in this directory should be safe.
#
# This file also keeps the directory present in git before the first
# `seal.sh adopt`, because the Argo CD Application names it as a source path.
*
!.gitignore
!*.sealed.yaml
